    <briefdescription>
<para>Communicator for single-threaded sequential tile traversal. Supports cooperative fiber suspension (Option A2) so iterative collective calls (sync_overlap_buffers, all_reduce, all_union, barrier) synchronize across all tiles using a disk-backed temporary <ref refid="structhmap_1_1VirtualArray" kindref="compound">VirtualArray</ref> (VA_DISK_LRU_STREAM). </para>
    </briefdescription>
